        <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg rounded-4">
            <div class="modal-header border-0 pb-0">
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body text-center pt-0 pb-5 px-4 px-sm-5">
                <div class="sc-problem-icon red mx-auto mb-4" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.5rem"><i class="bi bi-person-x"></i></div>
                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">Starting Alone</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">Starting a business all by yourself can be overwhelming. You have to handle everything from coding to marketing to sales. Solo founders often face severe burnout and high failure rates.</p>
                <p class="mb-0"><strong>How we help:</strong> StartupConnect helps you find co-founders who complement your skills, so you can share the load and build a diverse, strong team right from the beginning.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

